B2. root anatomy of the h-metallic forms (they are NOT real-rooted)
   q=1 g=6: all A_k>0=True squarefree(K=g)=True #real roots=0/6
   q=1 g=8: all A_k>0=True squarefree(K=g)=True #real roots=0/8
