   coefficients is all THM-3000's convention needs.

B3. the two 'metallic strata' are DISJOINT (except degenerately)
   root-metallic  = reciprocal-closed, 1 sign change  (MINIMAL alternation)
   coeff-metallic = maximal alternation g-3,          NOT reciprocal-closed
  [OK ] B3 the maximal-alternation metallic object lies OUTSIDE the reciprocal-closed stratum 

